    "rationale": "Wan2.2 I2V-A14B combines Apache-2.0 provenance, exact prepared-package inventory, a pinned MLX-Gen wheel and source commit, verified native Apple Silicon support, and published M5 Max resource evidence. LTX-2.5 Fast is now locally viable but remains deferred because its Apple path is newly released beta software, its 22B weights are gated under a custom community license, and no comparable pinned M5 Max runtime, determinism, or offline proof profile is published."
  },
